# Published Google Sheet CSV URL.
# In Google Sheets: File → Share → Publish to web → (sheet) → CSV → copy the URL.
# Must be PUBLIC_-prefixed so Astro exposes it to the client (the URL is public anyway).
PUBLIC_STICKER_CSV_URL=

# The /submit upload page needs two Worker secrets (NOT .env vars) — set them with
# `wrangler secret put`:  SHEET_WEBHOOK_URL, SHEET_WEBHOOK_TOKEN. See README → Submissions.

# ── Street View (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Both come from one Google Cloud project (billing must be enabled — usage is $0).
# Leave them blank to disable Street View entirely; the map works without them.
#
# Public, build-time. Used client-side in the embed iframe. Restrict it to the
# Maps Embed API + your HTTP referrers (stickers.siddharthbobba.com/*, localhost:*).
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_KEY=
# Worker secret. Used server-side by /api/streetview for the (free) coverage
# pre-check. Restrict it to the Street View Static API. Locally it can live here;
# in prod set it with `wrangler secret put GOOGLE_STREETVIEW_KEY`.
GOOGLE_STREETVIEW_KEY=
